      ],
      "source": "https://discoversouthcarolina.com/articles/explore-the-historic-small-town-of-edgefield"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Edgefield's historic district features forty nineteenth-century buildings, including three house museums that chronicle the town's history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
